<newsitem itemid="538630" id="root" date="1997-04-25" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: OTK raises yr shr, div.</title>
<headline>OTK raises yr shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended February 28</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Combined unit</p>
<p>    - attrib (cts)	  61.3	  vs 51.1</p>
<p>    - div (cts)	     20.4	  vs 17.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   193.3	 vs 154.8</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   266.6	 vs 219.6</p>
<p>    Tax			 73.3	  vs 66.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		  2,298.6     vs 1,963.9</p>
<p>Div payable June 20</p>
<p>on register June 13</p>
<p>Full name: OTK Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     none	  vs 1.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said capitalisation shares would be awarded, details of which will be made public on May 23.</p>
<p>They said the firm was invovled in talks to create certain levels of co-operation in the agriculture industry. Special attention was being given to improving marketing, and growth in market share was anticipated.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
